# Slack Standup Bot Rules

This rule applies the following guidance when developing the Slack Standup Bot:

- Follow the project architecture and code organization in `project-rules.mdc`
- Adhere to backend development standards in `backend-rules.mdc`
- Use cursor and editor standards from `cursor-rules.mdc`
- Refer to the implementation guide in `implementation-guide.mdc` for technical details
- Always update lesson-learnt.mdc for debug issues, and refer it whenever debug a new issues so that you learn from previous mistake.
